# The preserved upstream Flix grammar checkout beside the carried Zed assets is
# untracked editor work, not project source and not a Bazel input. It is never
# declared, compiled or read into an action; this keeps Bazel's package
# discovery from scanning it. The read-only reference checkout `attuneflix/` and
# the agent/VCS metadata all live at the checkout root, outside this workspace.
platform/zed/grammars
